# Database (MySQL 8 + MyBatis Plus)

## Design
- InnoDB, utf8mb4, explicit indexes on FK and query hot paths
- Soft delete via `deleted` TINYINT (0/1) + `@TableLogic`
- Money/quantity: `DECIMAL(18,4)` — never FLOAT/DOUBLE
- Primary key: snowflake `BIGINT` (`IdType.ASSIGN_ID`)
- Audit: `created_at`, `updated_at`, `created_by`, `updated_by`

## Naming
- Tables: `模块前缀_业务` e.g. `erp_product`, `oa_approval`, `fin_receivable`
- Columns: snake_case; Java fields camelCase (MyBatis Plus map-underscore-to-camel-case)

## Migrations
- Schema scripts under `backend/sql/` versioned by date: `V20260813__init.sql`
- Do not auto-mutate production schema from entities

## MyBatis Plus
- Manage versions with `mybatis-plus-bom`
- Include `mybatis-plus-jsqlparser` for pagination (required since 3.5.9)
- Official: https://baomidou.com/getting-started/install/

## Performance
- Avoid N+1: batch queries / joins in XML when needed
- Redis for hot dict and short-lived stock locks where justified
- Paginate list APIs with MyBatis Plus `Page`
